            "topological" ;
        ibco:sourceNode ibc:ibc2021-ch10-list_item-0190 ;
        ibco:statementType "permission" ;
        ibco:text "2. In assembly areas with ramped aisles or stepped aisles, one accessible means of egress is permitted where the common path of egress travel is accessible and meets the requirements in Section 1030.8." .

